"hadiths[30]{hadithnumber,text}:"
153701,"Yahya related to me from Malik from Ibn Shihab that as-Sa'ib ibn Yazid informed him that Umar ibn al-Khattab came out to them. He said, ""I have found the smell of wine on so-and-so, and he claimed that it was the drink of boiled fruit juice, and I am inquiring about what he has drunk. If it intoxicates, I will flog him."" Umar then flogged him with the complete hadd"
153702,"Yahya related to me from Malik from Ibn Shihab that as-Sa'ib ibn Yazid informed him that Umar ibn al-Khattab came out to them. He said, ""I have found the smell of wine on so-and-so, and he claimed that it was the drink of boiled fruit juice, and I am inquiring about what he has drunk. If it intoxicates, I will flog him."" Umar then flogged him with the complete hadd"
153801,Yahya related to me from Malik from Thawr ibn Zayd ad-Dili that Umar ibn al-Khattab asked advice about a man drinking wine. Ali ibn Abi Talib said to him
153802,Yahya related to me from Malik from Thawr ibn Zayd ad-Dili that Umar ibn al-Khattab asked advice about a man drinking wine. Ali ibn Abi Talib said to him
153901,"Yahya related to me from Malik from Ibn Shihab that he was asked about the hadd of the slave for wine. He said, ""I heard that he has half the hadd of a freeman for drinking wine. Umar ibn al-Khattab, Uthman ibn Affan, and Abdullah ibn Umar flogged their slaves with half of the hadd of a freeman when they drank wine"
153902,"Yahya related to me from Malik from Ibn Shihab that he was asked about the hadd of the slave for wine. He said, ""I heard that he has half the hadd of a freeman for drinking wine. Umar ibn al-Khattab, Uthman ibn Affan, and Abdullah ibn Umar flogged their slaves with half of the hadd of a freeman when they drank wine"
154001,Yahya related to me from Malik from Yahya ibn Said that he heard Said ibn al-Musayyab say
154002,Yahya related to me from Malik from Yahya ibn Said that he heard Said ibn al-Musayyab say
154101,Yahya related to me from Malik from Nafi from Abdullah ibn Umar that the Messenger of Allah
154102,Yahya related to me from Malik from Nafi from Abdullah ibn Umar that the Messenger of Allah
154201,Yahya related to me from Malik from al-Ala ibn Abd ar-Rahman ibn Yaqub from his father from Abu Hurayra that the Messenger of Allah
154202,Yahya related to me from Malik from al-Ala ibn Abd ar-Rahman ibn Yaqub from his father from Abu Hurayra that the Messenger of Allah
154301,Yahya related to me from Malik from Zayd ibn Aslam from Ata ibn Yasar that the Messenger of Allah
154302,Yahya related to me from Malik from Zayd ibn Aslam from Ata ibn Yasar that the Messenger of Allah
154401,Yahya related to me from Malik from a reliable source from Bukayr ibn Abdullah ibn al-Ashajj from Abd ar-Rahman ibn al-Hubab al-Ansari from Abu Qatada al-Ansari that the Messenger of Allah
154402,Yahya related to me from Malik from a reliable source from Bukayr ibn Abdullah ibn al-Ashajj from Abd ar-Rahman ibn al-Hubab al-Ansari from Abu Qatada al-Ansari that the Messenger of Allah
154501,Yahya related to me from Malik from ibn Shihab from Abu Salama ibn Abd ar-Rahman that A'isha
154502,Yahya related to me from Malik from ibn Shihab from Abu Salama ibn Abd ar-Rahman that A'isha
154601,Yahya related to me from Malik from Zayd ibn Aslam from Ata ibn Yasar that the Messenger of Allah
154602,Yahya related to me from Malik from Zayd ibn Aslam from Ata ibn Yasar that the Messenger of Allah
154701,Yahya related to me from Malik from Nafi from Abdullah ibn Umar that the Messenger of Allah
154702,Yahya related to me from Malik from Nafi from Abdullah ibn Umar that the Messenger of Allah
154801,"Yahya related to me from Malik from Zayd ibn Aslam that Ibn Wala al-Misri asked Abdullah ibn Abbas about what is squeezed from the grapes. Ibn Abbas replied, ""A man gave the Messenger of Allah, may Allah bless him and grant him peace, a small water-skin of wine. The Messenger of Allah, may Allah bless him and grant him peace, said to him, 'Don't you know that Allah has made it haram?' He said, 'No.' Then a man at his side whispered to him. The Messenger of Allah, may Allah bless him and grant him peace, asked what he had whispered, and the man replied, 'I told him to sell it.' The Messenger of Allah, may Allah bless him and grant him peace, said, 'The One who made drinking it haram has made selling it haram.' The man then opened the water- skins and poured out what was in them"
154802,"Yahya related to me from Malik from Zayd ibn Aslam that Ibn Wala al-Misri asked Abdullah ibn Abbas about what is squeezed from the grapes. Ibn Abbas replied, ""A man gave the Messenger of Allah, may Allah bless him and grant him peace, a small water-skin of wine. The Messenger of Allah, may Allah bless him and grant him peace, said to him, 'Don't you know that Allah has made it haram?' He said, 'No.' Then a man at his side whispered to him. The Messenger of Allah, may Allah bless him and grant him peace, asked what he had whispered, and the man replied, 'I told him to sell it.' The Messenger of Allah, may Allah bless him and grant him peace, said, 'The One who made drinking it haram has made selling it haram.' The man then opened the water- skins and poured out what was in them"
154901,"Yahya related to me from Malik from Ishaq ibn Abdullah ibn Abi Talha that Anas ibn Malik said, ""We would pray asr and anyone who then went to the Bani Amr ibn Awf would find them praying asr"
154902,"Yahya related to me from Malik from Ishaq ibn Abdullah ibn Abi Talha that Anas ibn Malik said, ""We would pray asr and anyone who then went to the Bani Amr ibn Awf would find them praying asr"
155001,Yahya related to me from Malik from Da'ud ibn al-Husayn that Waqid ibn Amr ibn Sad ibn Muadh informed him from Mahmud ibn Labid al- Ansari that when Umar ibn al-Khattab went to ash-Sham
155002,Yahya related to me from Malik from Da'ud ibn al-Husayn that Waqid ibn Amr ibn Sad ibn Muadh informed him from Mahmud ibn Labid al- Ansari that when Umar ibn al-Khattab went to ash-Sham
155101,Yahya related to me from Malik from Nafi from Abdullah ibn Umar that some men from Iraq said to him
155102,Yahya related to me from Malik from Nafi from Abdullah ibn Umar that some men from Iraq said to him
